      "text": "⛔️TRAFFIC ADVISORY - FENWAY/KENMORE:\nBoston 10K Road Race - Sun, June 22nd\nThe Boston 10K road race starts Sunday, June 22nd @ 8am.\nParking restrictions will be in place throughout Saturday and Sunday on the following streets:\nBeacon St - South side (Boston Common side), from Charles to Joy, and North side (opposite the Boston Common), from Charles to Spruce\nBoylston St - Both sides, from Arlington to Charles\nCharles St -  Both sides, from Boylston to Beacon\nCharles St - Both sides, from Beacon o Mt Vernon\nBoylston St - Both sides, from Exeter to Dartmouth\nBay State Rd -  Both sides, from Beacon to Silber\nSilber Way - Both sides, from Bay State Rd to Comm Ave\nhttps://t.co/hlY8CUhVIA",
